        {
          "id": 402270750,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Not a blocker but a personal preference to always brace the conditional code as it prevents surprises later on when someone adds another line.\n\nCould also add a comment explaining what's going on.\n\nI'm not entirely convinced this is the right solution, if I move the ciscodump.html file to the extcap directory, then everything works as excepted. If I create the personal extcap dir and move the ciscodump.exe and ciscodump.html files to it, then everything works as expected.\n\nI think the issue is a installer one in that it should install the extcap .html files in the same directory as the extcap binaries.",
