          "id": 402544657,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I tend to copy the style of the file I'm working in but now see that filesystem.c is a mix of with and without braces. Will add them if this moves forward. Per K&R: \"The position of braces is less important, although people hold passionate beliefs.\"  :-)<br>\n<br>\nThe Wireshark code seems very sparse on comments. Would love a sentence in the style guide for guidance.\n<br><br>\nHappy to rewrite the patch. Would like to see more discussion - seems like a big change to extcap based on the developer guide specifying only binaries in the extcap directory.",
