        {
          "id": 402550382,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Having had to fix too many bugs where lack of a brace caused issues I'm very passionate about them.  To be pedantic I wasn't making an observation about the positioning, more the lack of them.  Apart from the observations in README.developer we've not really had a style guide.  Easier to avoid such flamewars.\n\nAnyway, more to the point, does this change still work with an extcap (and it's .html) in the personal directory?",
