        {
          "id": 402580202,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I hope not. That's not the \"datafile\" directory per current definitions.<br>\n<br>\n`help_url = data_file_url(\"sshdump.html\");`<br>\n<br>\nComment in `data_file_url()`<br>\n`    /* XXX - check, if the file is really existing, otherwise display a simple_dialog about the problem */`<br>\n<br>\nThat would be suggestion 3 in #15592 - look for the file since it can be in different places.<br>\nShould the extcap help files be in a consistent location or should the code hunt for them?",
