        {
          "id": 402655687,
          "type": null,
          "body": "```\nadmin1@ubuntu1:~/wireshark$ for FILE in *deb; do dpkg-deb -c $FILE | grep -i ssh; done\n-rw-r--r-- root/root     11053 2016-10-17 05:05 ./usr/share/wireshark/sshdump.html\n-rwxr-xr-x root/root     31560 2016-10-17 05:05 ./usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/wireshark/extcap/sshdump\n-rw-r--r-- root/root      4294 2016-10-17 05:05 ./usr/share/man/man1/sshdump.1.gz\n```\n<br>\nWould the html move next to the binary on all platforms? (example above 3.2.6 deb packages)",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
